// Regression fixture for the built-in `PageInput` + `swr` preset codegen
// gap: a `PageInput` procedure argument is literal-inlined into the
// generated args interface (`ts_type`'s generic fallback) rather than
// imported as a named model type, so the ownership graph
// (`src/swr/ownership.rs::compute_type_ownership`) never sees it as a
// consumer edge — it only tracks user-declared enums/`type` blocks, not
// the `Page`/`PageInfo`/`PageInput` builtins. `src/swr/context.rs` has
// to add that import by hand, mirroring `swr_paged_model.cstack`'s own
// `Page` regression coverage.

type FeedReply {
  limit Int
  offset Int
}

procedure listFeed(page: PageInput): FeedReply
